  <NOTES 0 2
    |X-Air Network Bridge — REAPER template
    |Generic 18-channel layout (CH01–CH18). No user paths, no desk names.
    |Linux JACK: xair_net_bridge:NN_*_out = REAPER inputs; *_in = outputs
    |Windows: WASAPI/ASIO virtual cable (VB-Cable). macOS: CoreAudio BlackHole.
    |USB Return: last track, post-fader sends from 1–18, HWOUT 1–2 (stereo)
    |Plugins: always on track/bus OUTPUT feeding USB Return. Never input FX.
    |OSC: load ./reaper-osc/xair_network_bridge.ReaperOSC  listen 8000 → dest 127.0.0.1:9001
